-From 67d948ea2f9504c5af2979e83b531daaec51e607 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
-From: David Vincze <david.vincze@arm.com>
-Date: Wed, 8 Apr 2026 15:27:17 +0000
+From 24eee072bb9a8c9f495b3bca2f49047727fb9723 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Hien Le <hien.le.sx@bp.renesas.com>
+Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 09:59:39 +0000
 Subject: [PATCH] bootutil: Parse key ID for built-in keys
 
-When MCUBOOT_BUILTIN_KEY is enabled, the key id TLV entry is added
-to the image with the new IMAGE_TLV_KEYID type. Parse this entry while
-validating the image to identify the key used to sign the image.
-In this scenario the IMAGE_TLV_KEYHASH or IMAGE_TLV_PUBKEY entries
-are not needed.
-
-This replaces the previous PoC code that simply assigned the
-image_index to the key ID.
-
-Signed-off-by: Maulik Patel <maulik.patel@arm.com>
